'''Muted Bark''' is an {{Uncommon}} item.

== Obtaining ==
=== Mob Drops ===
{{Drop Sources}}

== Usage ==
Clicking on the log in {{zone|The Bastion (Rift)}} surrounded by particles at {{Coords|-15|91|94}} with different amounts of '''Muted Bark''' will trigger different messages. Holding {{Item|Muted Bark|amount=20}} and interacting with the log will remove it and reveal an {{Item|Enigma Soul}}.

